        "operationId" : "postCasesFromEntities",
        "description" : "LA-CASE-CREATE-IN-PLACE-1. Each {id, dataset} entry is a Link Analysis Entity (node id entity:[<type>:]<normalised key>, D-S4) and is minted as an INCIDENT keyed by entityKey + entityDataset, or REUSED when that identity already exists and is visible to the caller; an {objectId} entry names an existing Incident. The Case CONTAINS every member. Gated on canManageIncidents (403). Missing title or no entities 400; a malformed entity, a non-INCIDENT objectId or more than 100 entities 422; an absent or out-of-scope objectId 404. Everything is checked before the first write, and a failed write rolls back every object the call created.",
